{"id":"24f070f6d4e398b7","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-order11-distributive-lattice.md","title":"ZFC Order11 Distributive Lattice","display":"df-zfc-order11-distributive-lattice — ZFC Order11 Distributive Lattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order11-distributive-lattice","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order11-distributive-lattice"],"display":"df-zfc-order11-distributive-lattice — ZFC Order11 Distributive Lattice","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-poset-lattice]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order11-distributive-lattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order11-distributive-lattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order11-distributive-lattice — ZFC Order11 Distributive Lattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"79109424a5779d49\" href=\"?note=79109424a5779d49\" title=\"58-df-zfc-poset-lattice\">58-df-zfc-poset-lattice</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (lattice carrier, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"79109424a5779d49\" href=\"?note=79109424a5779d49\" title=\"58-df-zfc-poset-lattice\">58-df-zfc-poset-lattice</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_L\\subseteq L\\times L\">\\(\\leq_L\\subseteq L\\times L\\)</span> (lattice order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S\\)</span> (lattice predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"79109424a5779d49\" href=\"?note=79109424a5779d49\" title=\"58-df-zfc-poset-lattice\">58-df-zfc-poset-lattice</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_L,\\vee_L\">\\(\\wedge_L,\\vee_L\\)</span> (meet and join on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11DistributiveLattice}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11DistributiveLattice}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11DistributiveLattice}_S(L,\\leq_L,\\wedge_L,\\vee_L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S(L,\\leq_L)\\land\\wedge_L,\\vee_L:L\\times L\\to L\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\\Bigl((x\\wedge_Ly)\\leq_Lx\\land(x\\wedge_Ly)\\leq_Ly\n\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;((u\\leq_Lx\\land u\\leq_Ly)\\to u\\leq_L(x\\wedge_Ly))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land x\\leq_L(x\\vee_Ly)\\land y\\leq_L(x\\vee_Ly)\n\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;((x\\leq_Lu\\land y\\leq_Lu)\\to(x\\vee_Ly)\\leq_Lu)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in L\\;\\bigl(x\\wedge_L(y\\vee_Lz)=(x\\wedge_Ly)\\vee_L(x\\wedge_Lz)\n\\land x\\vee_L(y\\wedge_Lz)=(x\\vee_Ly)\\wedge_L(x\\vee_Lz)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11DistributiveLattice}_S(L,\\leq_L,\\wedge_L,\\vee_L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S(L,\\leq_L)\\land\\wedge_L,\\vee_L:L\\times L\\to L\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\\Bigl((x\\wedge_Ly)\\leq_Lx\\land(x\\wedge_Ly)\\leq_Ly\n\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;((u\\leq_Lx\\land u\\leq_Ly)\\to u\\leq_L(x\\wedge_Ly))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land x\\leq_L(x\\vee_Ly)\\land y\\leq_L(x\\vee_Ly)\n\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;((x\\leq_Lu\\land y\\leq_Lu)\\to(x\\vee_Ly)\\leq_Lu)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in L\\;\\bigl(x\\wedge_L(y\\vee_Lz)=(x\\wedge_Ly)\\vee_L(x\\wedge_Lz)\n\\land x\\vee_L(y\\wedge_Lz)=(x\\vee_Ly)\\wedge_L(x\\vee_Lz)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The supplied operations are constrained to be the actual greatest lower bounds and least upper bounds for the declared order before distributivity is imposed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-poset-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"79109424a5779d49","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-poset-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-poset-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"79109424a5779d49","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ (lattice carrier, see [[58-df-zfc-poset-lattice]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-poset-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"79109424a5779d49","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S$ (lattice predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-poset-lattice]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_L\\subseteq L\\times L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge_L,\\vee_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11DistributiveLattice}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11DistributiveLattice}_S(L,\\leq_L,\\wedge_L,\\vee_L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S(L,\\leq_L)\\land\\wedge_L,\\vee_L:L\\times L\\to L\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\\Bigl((x\\wedge_Ly)\\leq_Lx\\land(x\\wedge_Ly)\\leq_Ly\n\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;((u\\leq_Lx\\land u\\leq_Ly)\\to u\\leq_L(x\\wedge_Ly))\\\\\n&\\hspace{28mm}\\land x\\leq_L(x\\vee_Ly)\\land y\\leq_L(x\\vee_Ly)\n\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;((x\\leq_Lu\\land y\\leq_Lu)\\to(x\\vee_Ly)\\leq_Lu)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in L\\;\\bigl(x\\wedge_L(y\\vee_Lz)=(x\\wedge_Ly)\\vee_L(x\\wedge_Lz)\n\\land x\\vee_L(y\\wedge_Lz)=(x\\vee_Ly)\\wedge_L(x\\vee_Lz)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1598,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2884","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-order11-distributive-lattice.md|58-df-zfc-order11-distributive-lattice]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","79109424a5779d49"]}